# A local inline method called before its definition across a lazy val an import of the block reads (scalac's E039
# at the call): the call's check of the definition goes with what it reported there and the claim it took, and the
# block's own check of the definition reports its deprecation again, as one worker's walk does, under every warning
# setting (without, the attached workers lost the warning: the kept claim had the later check drop it).
1 --deprecation
1
1 --werror
1 --wconf any:e
